:: Nightmare Alex
<<effects>><<nightmareStart "Alex">><<set $location to "alex_cottage">>
<<npc Alex>><<person1>>

A loud bang jolts you awake. The sound of footsteps echo from somewhere below you. Glancing around, you see a room in disarray and blacked-out windows.
